                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The OBBB makes every Medicaid dollar work smarter for Nebraskans who need it most. Some of the media and the left has been pushing false Democrat talking points about this generational bill.\n\nMedicaid is going to continue to grow by $750 billion over the next ten years. This will make sure that it is still serving those who need it most: kids, elderly, and the disabled.",
