                "retweet_count": 16,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Liberal states have been draining your tax dollars to give healthcare to illegal immigrants. The One Big Beautiful Bill gets Medicaid back on track. It preserves Medicaid for Americans who need it most.\n\n@SenateGOP is delivering on your priorities.",
