                "retweet_count": 9,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The One Big Beautiful Bill gets Medicaid back on track. In the past, Medicaid dollars have gone to dead people or people registered in two states. But that ended with the One Big Beautiful Bill. Medicaid dollars are now going to those who need them the most.",
