                "reply_count": 25,
                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The best part of my job as U.S. Senator is that I get to work for Nebraskans. Through the passage of the OBBB, we are avoiding a $2,443 tax hike on Nebraskans. We are helping seniors keep more of their Social Security benefits.  We\u2019re improving healthcare and veterans\u2019 services. I\u2019m proud of the work my team and I have done fighting for Nebraska this year.",
