                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I\u2019m committed to ensuring veterans across the state have access to quality healthcare. That\u2019s why I introduced the CARING for Our Veterans Health Act. This bill will make it easier for VA Care Providers to access patient medical records from non-VA hospitals. That will help veterans get the proper care they deserve!",
