                "text": "Great to meet with Hy-Vee's CEO Jeremy Gosch and other Hy-Vee teammates. We discussed Hy-Vee's role in increasing access to healthy foods. This initiative will help deliver personalized health and wellness benefits to Medicaid, Medicare and other health insurance beneficiaries.\n\nHy-Vee is also a champion for biofuels. Last time I filled up at Hy-Vee, I saved 45 cents a gallon on E10. Thanks for coming by!",
