                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I\u2019m supporting the Good Life in the Senate. This year, Congress made the largest ever investment in American rural healthcare. The Working Families Tax Cut Act eliminates the federal tax on tips on up to $25,000 per year. The bill also avoided a $2,400 tax hike for the average Nebraska family.\n\nThese are just a few of the big wins delivered for Nebraskans this year.",
